meta {
  name: Spaces - Visit
  type: http
  seq: 179
}

put {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a space>/visit
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The current member visited the space (#1476, ADR 0048): the dot of the space in the navigation goes. One row per member and space, replaced at each visit. The web pages of a space write it already: the client calls this route when a space opens without a page load. Only a member of the community who can view the space visits it (403 otherwise): a visitor and a signed-in person who is not a member never get a row. Needs notifications:write.
}
